    "description": "As a Frontend Developer at Fannie Mae, I develop responsive web applications using Angular and React.js, improving performance through lazy loading, code splitting, and caching, which boosted page load speeds by 30%. I integrate RESTful APIs for smooth data synchronization and build Single Page Applications (SPAs), enhancing navigation and reducing load times by 25%.\n\nI optimize deployment using AWS Amplify, S3, CloudFront, and Cognito for security and scalability. Additionally, I streamline processes with Docker, Jenkins, and AWS Code Pipeline, cutting deployment time by 40%. My work also includes testing with Jest and Cypress, collaborating in Scrum teams, and ensuring code quality, security, and WCAG accessibility standards.",
